===============================================================================
1. SCOPE
===============================================================================

(a) SOFTWARE: MIT License (Part 2)
    All source code, including the JavaScript, HTML, CSS and Python files, the
    tests, the scripts in scripts/, the tools in tools/, the trailer pipeline
    source in trailer/ and the agent skills in .claude/skills/, except the
    items in (b) and Part 4.

(b) ART, AUDIO AND MEDIA: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
    International (Part 3)
    - The character, pickup and cabinet designs: the visual appearance of
      the sprites that character-art.js, item-art.js, art.js, controls.js,
      backdrops.js and trailer/src/hero-art.js produce. The code that draws
      them is under (a). The designs it draws are under (b).
    - All generated audio: assets/audio/*.wav, assets/audio/manifest.json and
      the embedded sound data in sound-bank.js.
    - Everything in docs/media/ (screenshots, sprite renders, animations).
    - The written storyboard in trailer/STORYBOARD.md.

    Attribution: "SORA-MAN · AI Arcade by the SORA-MAN contributors", with a
    link to this repository.

(c) THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS: their own licences (Part 4).

If you are unsure which part covers a file, treat code as (a) and anything you
see or hear as (b).

