===============================================================================
4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
===============================================================================

- p5.js 2.x (vendor/p5.min.js)
  (c) the Processing Foundation and contributors.
  GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 (LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt).
  Source: https://github.com/processing/p5.js

- Crackman Front font (assets/fonts/)
  By Raymond Larabie. CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication).
  See assets/fonts/license.txt.

- p5.brush and Playwright (trailer/package.json)
  Development dependencies of the trailer pipeline. They are installed by npm
  and not included in this repository. MIT and Apache-2.0 respectively.

- jfxr (https://github.com/ttencate/jfxr)
  By Thomas ten Cate. BSD 3-Clause. Not included; scripts/generate-jfxr-demo.js
  loads it from a local checkout (see scripts/AUDIO.md).

- masonicGIT/pacman (https://github.com/masonicGIT/pacman)
  Shaun Williams' remake, GPL-3.0. This project used it as a reference only.
  mazegen.js reimplements the idea of its piece-based maze generator from
  scratch for an endless climb and contains no code from it.

- Rules research: the arcade game's behaviour as documented by the community
  in "The Pac-Man Dossier". No ROM, graphics or recordings from the arcade
  game are included in this repository or in the game.

